# Local investigation artifacts, including copied third-party pages and scripts.
reports/
# Captured third-party pages, scripts and API responses stay local; only provenance
# records (*.md) and manifests are committed. Tests needing a missing capture are skipped.
tests/fixtures/*
!tests/fixtures/*.md
!tests/fixtures/*_manifest.json
